# Online load test: vLLM serving at bf16, fp16 and fp8 (RTX 4090)

Model Qwen/Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct, 128 output tokens per request (EOS suppressed), streaming, open-loop Poisson arrivals (seed 2122), prompts cycle through the same 32 prompts as the offline benchmark.
SLA used for goodput: TTFT <= 500 ms and TPOT <= 50 ms per request. SLA capacity = highest offered rate where >= 95% of requests met it.

